#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete all the Port to MAC to IP results from the system?"
msgstr "Da li ste sigurni da želite obrisati sve rezultate mapiranja portova, MAC i IP adresa iz sistema?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete the expired Port to MAC to IP results now?"
msgstr "Da li ste sigurni da želite sada obrisati istekle rezultate mapiranja portova, MAC i IP adresa?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to purge the cached Mactrack scanning functions?"
msgstr "Da li ste sigurni da želite očistiti keširane Mactrack funkcije skeniranja?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete all the Aggregated Port to MAC to IP results from the system?"
msgstr "Da li ste sigurni da želite obrisati sve agregirane rezultate mapiranja portova, MAC i IP adresa iz sistema?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete and recreate all the Aggregated Port to MAC to IP results from the system?"
msgstr "Da li ste sigurni da želite obrisati i ponovo kreirati sve agregirane rezultate mapiranja portova, MAC i IP adresa iz sistema?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to download and import the IEEE Vendor MAC/OUI database now?"
msgstr "Da li ste sigurni da želite sada preuzeti i uvesti IEEE bazu proizvođača MAC/OUI adresa?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to rebuild the scan date list from the stored Port to MAC to IP results now?"
msgstr "Da li ste sigurni da želite sada ponovo izgraditi listu datuma skeniranja iz sačuvanih rezultata mapiranja portova, MAC i IP adresa?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Rebuild and analyze the partition containing the latest port observation, which is the current week with weekly partitions. An unpartitioned table is optimized in full. Scheduled scans are skipped while this runs. Continue?"
msgstr "Ponovo izgradi i analiziraj particiju koja sadrži najnovije opažanje porta, što je tekuća sedmica kod sedmičnih particija. Neparticionisana tabela se optimizuje u potpunosti. Zakazana skeniranja se preskaču dok se ovo izvršava. Nastaviti?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Run this maintenance off hours. The rebuild copies the full history of the port (MAC address), IP address and 802.1x tables one after the other and can take hours. Scheduled scans are skipped, database maintenance waits, and MAC, IP and 802.1x searching shows a maintenance message until it finishes. Allow free disk space for a second copy of each table and its indexes. Continue?"
msgstr "Pokrenite ovo održavanje izvan radnog vremena. Ponovna izgradnja kopira kompletnu historiju tabela portova (MAC adresa), IP adresa i 802.1x jednu za drugom i može trajati satima. Zakazana skeniranja se preskaču, održavanje baze podataka čeka, a pretraga MAC, IP i 802.1x podataka prikazuje poruku o održavanju dok se proces ne završi. Obezbijedite slobodan prostor na disku za drugu kopiju svake tabele i njenih indeksa. Nastaviti?"

