#: setup.php
msgid "Optional.  A regular expression matched, without regard to case, against the port name and the port alias of every scanned port.  MAC addresses found on a matching port are not collected, which keeps uplink and trunk ports out of the database.  For example, (uplink|trunk).  Put each expression on its own line to give several.  Leave empty to collect every port.  Sites and devices can add their own expressions.  Unlike Ports to Ignore above, this applies to MAC collection and not to the interface list, and it affects new scans only."
msgstr "Opcionalno. Regularni izraz koji se, bez obzira na veličinu slova, upoređuje s nazivom porta i aliasom porta svakog skeniranog porta. MAC adrese pronađene na podudarnom portu se ne prikupljaju, čime se uplink i trunk portovi drže izvan baze podataka. Na primjer, (uplink|trunk). Stavite svaki izraz u zaseban red da biste naveli više njih. Ostavite prazno da biste prikupili svaki port. Lokacije i uređaji mogu dodati vlastite izraze. Za razliku od opcije Portovi za zanemarivanje iznad, ovo se odnosi na prikupljanje MAC adresa, a ne na listu interfejsa, i utiče samo na nova skeniranja."

