msgid "MAC Address Match"
msgstr "Podudaranje MAC adrese"

#: setup.php
msgid "Please enter the MAC Address or Mac Address Match string to be automatically authorized.  If you wish to authorize a group of MAC Addresses, you can use the wildcard character of '&#37;' anywhere in the MAC Address."
msgstr "Molimo unesite MAC adresu ili string za podudaranje MAC adrese koji će biti automatski autorizovan. Ako želite autorizovati grupu MAC adresa, možete koristiti zamjenski znak '&#37;' bilo gdje u MAC adresi."

